posts.text:
When Josh Hawley was Missouri AG, he refused to charge the jail guards who murdered Tory Sanders, a Black man, by kneeling on his neck. 

@HawleyMO didn’t just get blood on his hands now—it’s been there. White supremacy allowed him to go on without consequence.

Not on my watch.

